          {
            "candidate": "houhanshu:121:cand_377dc7dbd1b45451",
            "action": "link",
            "personId": "houhanshu:121:p064",
            "kind": "personal-name",
            "note": "In s0165 the local narrative explicitly begins with Zhongli Yi as chancellor of Lu. The shortened Yi opening the ancient documents is this same official, not the unrelated Yi represented by p008."
          },
          {
            "candidate": "houhanshu:121:cand_c7c6eab1b781d045",
            "action": "link",
            "personId": "houhanshu:121:p064",
            "kind": "personal-name",
            "note": "In s0165 Yi investigating the missing disk continues Zhongli Yi's inspection and inquiry. The Chinese explicitly repeats his given name in this continuous story."
          },
          {
            "candidate": "houhanshu:121:cand_4012d4db947db9d6",
            "action": "link",
            "personId": "houhanshu:121:p064",
            "kind": "personal-name",
            "note": "In s0165 Zhongli Yi questions Zhang Bo about the seventh disk. Yi is the chancellor conducting the inquiry, not the soldier or the earlier unrelated Yi."
          },
          {
            "candidate": "houhanshu:121:cand_ee70706b92b4adda",
            "action": "link",
            "personId": "houhanshu:121:p064",
            "kind": "personal-name",
            "note": "The separate biography of Yi cited in s0165 is Zhongli Yi's biography; the ensuing account again explicitly names him. This is a personal-name reference inside a source attribution, not evidence of an additional living date."
          },
          {
            "candidate": "houhanshu:121:cand_9dbf06875d76d1da",
            "action": "link",
            "personId": "houhanshu:121:p064",
            "kind": "personal-name",
            "note": "The Yi inspecting the hall in the quotation from his separate biography is Zhongli Yi, the official whose temple restoration is being described throughout s0165."
          },
          {
            "candidate": "houhanshu:121:cand_ba3318e58160eb2e",
            "action": "link",
            "personId": "houhanshu:121:p064",
            "kind": "personal-name",
            "note": "The Yi paying for repairs in s0165 is Zhongli Yi, still the subject of the cited biography. The explicit full name later in the same quotation confirms the local reference."
          }
        ]
      },
